[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（アイドルとして、成し遂げたい夢……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(A dream I want to achieve as an idol...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（アタシはどうしてアイドルになりたいって\n\u3000思ったんだっけ）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Why did I want to become an idol in the first place?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アイドルって素晴らしいですね……！\n見ていると、心が躍ります！\u3000元気になります！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Idols are so wonderful...! Watching them makes my heart race! They make me feel energized!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（レスナちゃんが、楽しそうにしてたから）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Because Resna looked so happy...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "頑張れ、イザナちゃん！\n応援してるよー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Do your best, Izana! I'm rooting for you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（レスナちゃんが、応援してくれたから）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Because Resna cheered me on...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イザナちゃん、みんな！\u3000とっても良かったよ！\n私もすっごく楽しかった！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana, everyone! That was wonderful! I had such a great time!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（レスナちゃんが、見てくれたから）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Because Resna was watching me...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（レスナちゃんにアタシを見てほしくて、\n\u3000レスナちゃんの期待に応えたくて、アタシは――）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I wanted Resna to watch me. I wanted to live up to her expectations. That's why I—)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（でも、本当にそれだけ？）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(But is that really all there is to it?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（ライブすっごく楽しかった。\n\u3000アタシ、アイドルをとっても楽しんでた）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The live performance was so much fun. I really enjoyed being an idol.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（この楽しさを、\n\u3000世界中のみーんなに伝えたいなって思ったんだ！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I wanted to share that joy with everyone in the whole world!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アイドルとしてのアタシの夢、それは――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My dream as an idol is—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ねぇ二人とも！\u3000２ｎｄライブに向けて、\nアタシから提案があるんだけど！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, you two! I have a suggestion for our second live performance!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おおっ？\u3000なんでございますか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh? What might that be?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "みんなで宣伝のためにチラシ配りをしよう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's all hand out flyers to promote it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……チラシ配り？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Handing out flyers?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん！\u3000１ｓｔライブのお客さんが少なかったのって、\nライブがあるって知らなかったからだと思うんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah! I think the reason we had so few people at our first show was because they didn't know about it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だから、明後日ここでライブがありますよーって、\nみんなでチラシを配って宣伝しようよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So let's hand out flyers and tell everyone there's a live performance here the day after tomorrow!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "次はもっとたくさんお客さんを呼びたいから！\nそれでアタシたちのライブを楽しんでもらいたいから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I want to get more people to come next time! And I want them to enjoy our show!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……どうかな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...What do you think?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いいでござるな！\u3000早速チラシを用意いたしましょう！\n拙者の忍術で配りまくるでござる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sounds good! Let's prepare the flyers right away! I'll hand them out all over using my ninjutsu!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "チラシ配りだなんて、前時代的ね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Handing out flyers is so old-fashioned..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、やるわ。集客の基本は足よね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But I'll do it. Getting people there starts with footwork."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やったあ！\u3000よーし、みんな頑張ろー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yay! All right, let's give it our all, everyone!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]